<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>Farming</Major>
    <Description>It doesn't work on all fields, and the best farming on clover can be disrupted by acceleration tokens. Macro is not suitable for everyone, and I came up with this idea when I was making a quest in Bee swarm simulator Roblox.</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>2</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>KeyDown 26 1
KeyDown 79 1
LeftDown 1</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Roblox</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>